  {
   "kop": "Onderweg",
   "blokken": [
    {
     "soort": "tekst",
     "html": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;text-align:left;\"><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">Engels</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">Nederlands</th></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">a <strong>return ticket</strong> / a <strong>single ticket</strong></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">heen en terug / enkele reis (VS: round trip / one way)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">a <strong>coach</strong></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">een touringcar</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">a <strong>ferry</strong></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">een veerboot</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">a <strong>tram</strong></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">een tram</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">the Underground, the Tube</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">de metro van Londen</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">a <strong>subway</strong></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">in de VS de metro, in het VK een voetgangerstunnel</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">a <strong>platform</strong></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">het perron</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">a <strong>delay</strong>, to be delayed</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">vertraging hebben (afgeschaft is cancelled)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\"><strong>luggage</strong>, a suitcase</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">bagage, een koffer</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">a <strong>boarding pass</strong>, to check in</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">de instapkaart, inchecken</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">a <strong>youth hostel</strong>, a <strong>campsite</strong>, a <strong>bed and breakfast</strong></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">jeugdherberg, camping, logies met ontbijt</td></tr></table>"
    },
    {
     "soort": "tekst",
     "html": "Op het bord in het station lees je <em>The 10.20 to Leeds is delayed by 15 minutes</em>: die trein heeft <strong>een kwartier vertraging</strong>. En <strong>luggage</strong> krijgt geen meervouds-s: <em>my luggage is heavy</em>, net als information en furniture."
