  {
   "kop": "Weer, tijd, plaats en scherm",
   "blokken": [
    {
     "soort": "tekst",
     "html": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;text-align:left;\"><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">Weer</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">Betekenis</th></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\"><strong>drizzle</strong></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">motregen, heel fijne lichte regen</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">a downpour</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">een stortbui</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\"><strong>hail</strong> / <strong>thunder</strong></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">hagel / donder</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\"><strong>mild</strong>, <strong>freezing</strong>, <strong>foggy</strong></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">zacht, ijskoud, mistig</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">the (weather) <strong>forecast</strong></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">de weersvoorspelling</td></tr></table>"
    },
    {
     "soort": "tekst",
     "html": "De tijd is de grootste valstrik van allemaal. Het Engels telt vanaf het uur dat <strong>voorbij</strong> is, het Nederlands noemt het uur dat <strong>komt</strong>."
    },
